00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:31.966 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La Société de transport de

00:00:28.262 --> 00:00:33.934 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal vient d'acquérir une

00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:35.669 size:53% position:73% line:53%
