00:00:48.149 --> 00:00:52.820 size:53% position:73% line:53%
PASCAL RENAUD, dir. d'études

00:00:49.884 --> 00:00:54.321 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Société de transport de Montréal

00:00:51.619 --> 00:00:55.856 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est un bus qui est

00:00:53.154 --> 00:00:57.358 size:53% position:73% line:53%
silencieux, c'est un bus qui a

00:00:54.655 --> 00:00:58.893 size:53% position:73% line:53%
