00:01:05.332 --> 00:01:08.969 size:53% position:73% line:53%
routes, pointe AM, pointe PM

00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:10.170 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour faire les sorties du matin

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:11.405 size:53% position:73% line:53%
