00:01:10.504 --> 00:01:13.874 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour la recharge

00:01:11.739 --> 00:01:15.075 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On ne verra donc pas, dans

00:01:12.973 --> 00:01:16.610 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'avenir, une multiplication des

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:18.012 size:53% position:73% line:53%
