00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:24.218 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comme celui de Stinson.

00:01:21.515 --> 00:01:25.753 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ce qu'on a ici, c'est

00:01:23.017 --> 00:01:27.254 size:53% position:73% line:53%
12 chargeurs de 150 kw qui

00:01:24.552 --> 00:01:28.789 size:53% position:73% line:53%
