00:02:33.787 --> 00:02:37.992 size:53% position:73% line:53%
électrification.

00:02:35.289 --> 00:02:39.493 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La première phase de 670

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:42.530 size:53% position:73% line:53%
